{"book":"proverbs","lang":"en","model":"glm-5.2","timestamp":"2026-07-23T09:44:34.501319098Z","verse":8,"ref":"proverbs 25:8","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":25,"translation":"Do not go out hastily to quarrel, lest ⟨you do not know⟩ what you will do in its aftermath when your neighbor humbles ⟨את⟩ you.","tokens":[{"surface":"אל","gloss":"Do not"},{"surface":"תצא","gloss":"go out"},{"surface":"לרב","gloss":"to quarrel"},{"surface":"מהר","gloss":"hastily"},{"surface":"פן","gloss":"lest"},{"surface":"מה","gloss":"what"},{"surface":"תעשה","gloss":"you will do"},{"surface":"באחריתה","gloss":"in its end"},{"surface":"בהכלים","gloss":"when he puts to shame"},{"surface":"אתך","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"you"},{"surface":"רעך","gloss":"your neighbor"}]}